# Inquisition of Kozilek: "a nonland card from it with mana value 3 or less". Bot2's hand holds only Islands and a Sunfall
# (mana value 5), so nothing in it is eligible: the question is asked of Bot1 with no card to take (looking at the hand is
# part of the spell) and the unscripted answer takes nothing; the Sunfall stays in Bot2's hand and the graveyard is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Inquisition of Kozilek
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Sunfall
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Inquisition of Kozilek.Cast(Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Inquisition of Kozilek
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
